Subject: [PATCH] Washed cat walks out: hop out of the tub and trot out on
 CatReturned (#779)

Behind catWalkOut (off by default). On CatReturned the tub cat is hidden
locally; a local copy hops out with a puff, trots to SpotQueue1 and fades.
Reduced Motion fades it in place.

